    "UIName": "Berserker BRZ-QSK-R",
    "Id": "mechdef_berserker_BRZ-QSK-R",
    "Name": "Berserker BRZ-QSK-R",
    "Details": "Quicsell Berserker Mobile Artillery Platform™Here at Quicsell, we understand that your weapons of war need to last. That's why we're proud to introduce our latest innovation in artillery support platform capability: The Berserker Mobile Artillery Platform™!A towering installation of long-range firepower, the Berserker combines cutting-edge targeting sensors with Quicsell's famous discounted premium shelling! Whether you require a generous missile, a quality artillery shell to rout pesky infantry formations, or simply a good old-fashioned pelting, the Berserker has the firepower you need.Do they have a gun? Show them a bigger gun!Featuring the magnificent One Shot Longtom Cannon™, equipped with an extended barrel specifically engineered to really drive the point home. Literally. From a very, very long way away. In fact, Quicsell recommends remaining at a considerable distance from anything you intend to shoot.Inspire fear. Inspire awe. Inspire the enemy to reconsider their life choices. Put the Berserker to work on the battlefield today!Quicsell advises against firing all weaponry simultaneously, as doing so may void any applicable warranty on the purchase.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>",
    "Icon": "BerserkerP"
  },
